From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: Leaf Performance experiments <noreply@localhost>
Date: Mon, 14 Sep 2026 07:00:00 +0800
Subject: [PATCH] Avoid TemptingSensor fallback allocations

Select the nearest valid player directly in the custom-predicate fallback
instead of allocating and sorting a temporary list. Filter order, stable
equal-distance selection, Bukkit target event behavior, and the optimized
global lookup path remain unchanged.

Source inspiration: Lithium 26.1.x ai.sensor.replace_streams.tempting,
2No2Name, revision 701fb2e7636c6d634c76380c11232d27fd578dff.
License: LGPL-3.0-only; independently adapted to current Leaf 26.2.

diff --git a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/sensing/TemptingSensor.java b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/sensing/TemptingSensor.java
index fbb3ed2..5fb8492 100644
--- a/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/sensing/TemptingSensor.java
+++ b/net/minecraft/world/entity/ai/sensing/TemptingSensor.java
